    "label": "11",
    "prompt": "Wooden beams for building house frames can be purchased in a number of lengths.\nA hardware store can supply lengths of 850 millimetres, 80 centimetres, 190 centimetres, 0.855 metres and 1.8 metres.\nWhich wooden beam is the longest?",
